  <item>
    <title>EP18.秋季影单：降落在暖黄童话与冷灰现实之间</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6900b4e7558113deb7de6fb3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6900b4e7558113deb7de6fb3</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 Oct 2025 12:36:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【本期摘要】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>新一期的“秋季影单”也准时赴约啦。</span></p><span></span><p><span>秋天总带有一种复杂的诗意，既是收获与饱满，也是凋零与萧瑟。在本期节目中，我们将通过分享的四部电影，捕捉这种季节特有的双重性。我们从韦斯·安德森的《月升王国》聊起，看童真的暖黄色调如何包裹成长的孤独；在阿基·考里斯马基的《枯叶》里，体味北欧底层爱情中沉默的温情；汤唯主演的《晚秋》，则展现了压抑情感在灰蓝色调下的暗流涌动；而阿巴斯的《生生长流》，最终在灾后的土地上勾勒出生命本身的韧性，探讨每部电影的视听语言又如何与“秋意”共鸣。</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>【主播信息】</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>小梦：设计打工人，努力爬起来做图中...</span></p><span></span><p><span>hands：互联网垃圾制造者，嘴贱bug修复中...</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>Shownotes</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a>​​ 开场：探讨秋天所引发的观影情绪与选片思路</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="288">04:48</a>​​ 《月升王国》：解析韦斯·安德森如何用视觉美学构建秋日童话</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="842">14:02</a>​​ &nbsp;从童真冒险到成人失序：影片故事内核与视觉秩序的张力</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1122">18:42</a>​​ 《晚秋》：品读汤唯如何以克制表演演绎复杂情感</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1767">29:27</a>​​ &nbsp;细节分析：“好与坏”中文对话场景的情感象征意义</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2048">34:08</a>​​ 《枯叶》：解读北欧冷峻风格下的底层爱情与生活焦虑</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2364">39:24</a>​​ &nbsp;战争新闻收音机：分析这一听觉符号的社会隐喻功能</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2995">49:55</a>​​ &nbsp;从《枯叶》到《生生长流》：探讨不同文化背景下苦难与希望的表达</span></p><span></span><p><span>【电影剧照】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《月升王国》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg0hLzhfOqMwnxS_DpgtGXB2YQT8.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiAFP39zuPobKYYHA_Z9RQpAOEUS.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh5EK1DbZlnJEkCLBj4drqWpQMOq.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>《晚秋》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlTRS1l-HaEuB1F70NM6cHZFq1U5.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg85P0wd1Quk8QwJ00yxZkFh4QEq.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>《枯叶》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpobTIp9gGjK4jYpTpWIu2BJhP4D.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv2_CVin_IxOIOE3ZkLRIFcuXEyt.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>《生生长流》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuAgdhUWhBr47UY6slLQKGwO6TM6.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjcHfYRyvr5xMBk1HAbY__TTD2lV.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqXvvtsG5bm-ZbGKeTcL2toth_1p.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>片中提及观点仅代表主播个人想法，如果大家有不同的观点或对节目有更好的建议也欢迎多多留言~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期歌单】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Le Temps de l'Amour》- Francoise Hardy</span></p>]]></description>
