  <item>
    <title>【番外篇03】影展结算时刻，上影节终于活成了影迷痛骂的样子</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/685a76b84abe6e29cbc547d8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">685a76b84abe6e29cbc547d8</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 24 Jun 2025 10:00:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><strong><span>【本期摘要】</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>27届上海电影节饕餮盛宴结束了，但留给我们的回味不仅仅是电影的精彩，还有一肚子槽点！作为跑了N场、赶了N场的电影“特种兵”，我们在本期节目里要好好复盘一下本届上影节的观影奇遇记，​</span><strong><span>​</span></strong><span>犀利盘点本届上影节四宗罪！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【主播信息】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小梦：设计打工人，努力爬起来做图中...</span></p><span></span><p><span>hands：上影节特种兵休养生息中...</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>Shownotes</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a>《一江春水向东流》沪语版配音割裂，沪语日语交流无门槛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="155">02:35</a> 当了特种兵，看电影时真的坐不住了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">05:15</a> 热门影片放在工作日，大卫林奇EVA通宵马拉松，影展排片到底上没上过班</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="526">08:46</a> “情侣剪影”主海报到底是影展概念，还是人广相亲角的宣传招贴？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="678">11:18</a> 影展票涨价但赞助降级，请假全勤追影展的朋友们真的很富有了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="909">15:09</a> 上影节影院黑名单：沪北像菜市场，SHO小厅舒适度不如阶梯教室</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1310">21:50</a> 每年都更新的影展乐子今年再升级</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1478">24:38</a> 28siff许愿：票不涨价排片正常买到好影院</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【27届上影节海报】</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh7A3uN4UP6zgWFbX2yMAoVyOHqP.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>片中提及观点仅代表主播个人想法，如果大家有不同的观点或对节目有更好的建议也欢迎多多留言~如果你也喜欢影、剧、综相关内容，请不要忘记持续关注我们的正片哦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期歌单】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《LINDA LINDA》- The Blue Hearts</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/674c071899f942d5d4c3040e/ltfQfwnQWJzzmWoP2gFOwvRlNN5b.m4a" length="53371561" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:27:38</itunes:duration>
